根据乘法的分配律，边际概率 $p (x_{t})$ 可以通过下面方式进行计算：  
$$
\begin{array}{l} p \left(x_{t}\right) = \frac{1}{Z} \left(\sum_{x_{1}} \dots \sum_{x_{t - 1}} \prod_{j = 1}^{t - 1} \phi \left(x_{j}, x_{j + 1}\right)\right) \cdot \left(\sum_{x_{t + 1}} \dots \sum_{x_{T}} \prod_{j = t}^{T - 1} \phi \left(x_{j}, x_{j + 1}\right)\right) \\ = \frac{1}{Z} \left(\sum_{x_{t - 1}} \phi \left(x_{t - 1}, x_{t}\right) \dots \left(\sum_{x_{2}} \phi \left(x_{2}, x_{3}\right) \left(\sum_{x_{1}} \phi \left(x_{1}, x_{2}\right)\right)\right)\right) \cdot \\ \left(\sum_{x_{t + 1}} \phi \left(x_{t}, x_{t + 1}\right) \dots \left(\sum_{x_{T - 1}} \phi \left(x_{T - 2}, x_{T - 1}\right) \left(\sum_{x_{T}} \phi \left(x_{T - 1}, x_{T}\right)\right)\right)\right) \\ = \frac{1}{Z} \mu_{t - 1, t} \left(x_{t}\right) \mu_{t + 1, t} \left(x_{t}\right), \end{array} \tag{1}\tag{11.77}
$$  
其中 $\mu_{t - 1, t} (x_{t})$ 定义为变量 $X_{t - 1}$ 向变量 $X_{t}$ 传递的消息，定义为  
$$

